OL,3,GNEWSAPupil says 25-minute bus journey
OL,4,Anow takes an hour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old girl is spending two
OL,7,Fhours a day on a school bus following a
OL,8,Ftimetable change for the new academic
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FIsla, from Tetney, Lincolnshire, takes
OL,12,Fthe bus to King Edward VI Grammar
OL,13,FSchool in Louth and has seen her
OL,14,Fjourney time rise from 25 minutes to an
OL,15,Fhour each way.
OL,17,FHer mother, Clare, said the new
OL,18,Ftimetable was "failing the children of
OL,19,Fthe village".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
