OL,3,GNEWSAPupil says 25-minute bus journey
OL,4,Anow takes an hour
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Read, head of transport services
OL,7,Fat Lincolnshire County Council, said
OL,8,Fthe local authority was waiting for
OL,9,Fevidence from the family, but the
OL,10,Fchange had been made as part of a
OL,11,Freview designed to help ease congestion
OL,12,Fand pick up more children in the
OL,13,Fvillage.
